This week in Linear

Agents in Linear
Delegate an issue to a coding agent from any of the supported providers directly in Linear. The agent's progress, branches and pull requests show up on the issue.

Project milestones
Break a project into milestones with their own target dates and progress bars. Milestones roll up into the project's health.

New API
A rebuilt GraphQL API with webhooks for every object type, higher rate limits, and typed SDKs for TypeScript and Python.

Also shipped: issue templates per team, a redesigned inbox with grouping, and support for custom emoji reactions.

Full changelog: https://linear.app/changelog/2026-03-11

